    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm also worried about more subtle risks, like hidden fees or extra charges that aren't explicitly in the main pricing list but pop up later. how do i write the contract to make sure there aren't any \"hidden\" or sneaky things tucked away that could hurt us?",
