      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You must include an exhaustive \"Fees and Charges\" schedule that clearly itemizes *everything*, from shipping surcharges to administrative fees. A strong clause requiring *prior written consent* for *any* deviation from that schedule is crucial. Furthermore, mandate that the supplier must provide complete, itemized documentation for *every* charge they invoice you. This prevents them from sneaking in extra costs like \"handling fees\" that are only vaguely defined.",
      "source": "target",
